<title>JAPAN: Present forex rate won't affect Japan c/a soon - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Present forex rate won't affect Japan c/a soon - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Present foreign exchange rates are unlikely to lead to a significant change in Japan's current account balance in the near term, a senior Bank of Japan (BOJ) official tolds reporters on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
